This repository holds three kinds of material under different terms.

1. Code: every .py file. MIT License, text below.

2. Results data: scored_120.csv, grading/cells.csv, grading/truth.csv,
   grading/results.csv, grading/score_views/, grading/judge_check/,
   grading/flat_spot_check/,
   grading_rules.md, withheld_sources.txt, charts/, and each run folder's
   manifest.json and summary.csv. Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
   International (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ .
   Attribute to GTM Open.

3. Third-party content: saved page copies (runs/*/snapshots/*.json,
   grading/truth_pages/ and grading/judge_pages/) and vendor responses and
   the answers derived from them (runs/*/raw/, runs/*/records/,
   runs/*/state.json, and the Claygent run's meta/ and credits/). These
   belong to their owners. They are included for verification only and are
   not covered by either license above. Page copies from the sources in
   withheld_sources.txt (LinkedIn and paid company-data providers) are kept
   as metadata only, without their text.

